@startuml
title UC-001 — Normal 결정 수립
note as N
Product 명세 UC-001
end note
actor 사용자 as User
actor "Normal agent" as Agent
rectangle "Engineering Decision Layer" {
  usecase "System Characteristics 정리" as Characteristics
  usecase "관련 NFR 질문 선택" as Questions
  usecase "Current / Expected Growth / Architecture Boundary 목표 수집" as Targets
  usecase "목표값과 provenance 기록" as RecordTarget
  usecase "approved Principle 및 프로젝트 evidence 조회" as Lookup
  usecase "미확정 목표 조사 또는 정당화된 추정과 provenance 기록" as Resolve
  usecase "Code 결정 정리" as CodeDecision
  usecase "Infrastructure 결정 정리" as InfraDecision
  usecase "요구사항·목표·evidence·trade-off·scaling boundary 연결" as Trace
  usecase "결정 및 대안 선택; 기각 이유 보존" as Decide
  usecase "조사 또는 측정 대기" as Hold
}
Agent --> Characteristics
Characteristics --> Questions
Agent --> Targets
Targets --> RecordTarget
RecordTarget --> Lookup
Lookup --> Resolve
Resolve --> CodeDecision
Resolve --> InfraDecision
CodeDecision --> Trace
InfraDecision --> Trace
Agent --> Trace
Trace --> Decide
User --> Decide
Resolve --> Hold : material evidence 부족 또는 값 미확정
User --> Hold
note right of Characteristics
interaction, workload, state, consistency, availability, growth 특성에 관련된 질문만 선택한다.
end note
note bottom of Trace
Code와 Infrastructure 결정은 분리하며 각각 Problem, Constraints, Options, Evidence, Tradeoffs, Decision, Scaling Boundary를 연결한다.
end note
@enduml
